#: data/maps/FallarborTown_Mart/scripts.inc:48
msgctxt "FallarborTown_Mart_Text_DecidingSkittyEvolve"
msgid ""
"I'm having a hard time deciding if I\n"
"should make my SKITTY evolve or not.\p"
"I only have to use this MOON STONE,\n"
"but it's so hard to decide…\p"
"If I make it evolve, it will become\n"
"much stronger.\p"
"But it will look so different, too.$"
msgstr ""
"我很犹豫，\n"
"不知道该不该让我的向尾喵进化。\p"
"只要用这个月之石就行了，\n"
"可是真的好难决定……\p"
"让它进化的话，它会变得强得多。\p"
"但样子也会变得完全不一样。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_Mart/scripts.inc:57
msgctxt "FallarborTown_Mart_Text_Skitty"
msgid "SKITTY: Miyao?$"
msgstr "向尾喵：咪嗷？$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_Mart/scripts.inc:60
msgctxt "FallarborTown_Mart_Text_SellNuggetIFound"
msgid ""
"This NUGGET I found here…\n"
"I suppose I'll have to sell it, seeing\l"
"as how it has no other use.$"
msgstr ""
"我在这里捡到的这颗金珠……\n"
"反正也没别的用处，只好卖掉了吧。$"
